{"seq":3,"slug":"quality-scoring-suppression-remediation","title":"商品质量评分、渠道降权与修复闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-content-syndication-multichannel-feed-ops/compliance-validation-quality/quality-scoring-suppression-remediation","wordCount":2840,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"商品质量评分-渠道降权与修复闭环\">商品质量评分、渠道降权与修复闭环</h1><p>一个渠道的 5 万条商品两周内曝光掉了 38%，而同期回执里 <code>success</code> 占 99.2%，真正被拒的仅 400 条。剩下 1.2 万条商品仍在服务、仍能被搜到，只是排到了后面。这类损失不出现在「错误」里，也不出现在日报里。降权（demotion）是 syndication 里唯一一类「零回执、高损失」的故障：渠道不通知，你只能从流量斜率反推。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-质量不是布尔-是可服务性梯度\">核心概念：质量不是布尔，是可服务性梯度</h2><p>上传失败有两个对运维友好的性质——判定明确、回执写清楚了。降权两个都没有：它是渠道按一组质量信号连续调整单品排序权重的结果，表现为「商品还在，但免费列表不出现、广告竞价吃亏、搜索排序靠后」。所以本地必须把渠道判定建模成梯度而非 pass/fail，否则 1.2 万条降权商品会和 4.8 万条健康商品落进同一个 <code>approved</code> 桶。</p>\n<p>Google 官方给出了这个梯度的词汇表，并刻意避开了「降权」一词。商品级判定分三类：<strong>Warnings</strong>——「Products that receive warnings will continue to show across Google, however their performance may be limited」，未解决的 warning 可能升级为 disapproval；<strong>Disapprovals</strong>——「Disapproved products stop showing across Google」，须修复后重新审批；<strong>Preemptive item disapproval（PID）</strong>——由 feed 与落地页的价格或库存不一致触发，需人工复审（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/2948694\">https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/2948694</a> ）。账号级再加一层：warning 期限内未修复进入 suspension，严重违规则「suspended upon detection and without prior warning」。「demotion」「suppression」在这份官方文档里并不存在，它们是行业描述词；本地可拿它们做列名，但映射回渠道接口时必须落到官方等级，否则回执 join 不上。</p>\n<p>另一个线索是 Content API 的 <code>Severity</code> 枚举，它把「等级」和「该不该修」绑在一起：<code>ERROR</code> 会导致账号 suspend 或 item disapproval，<code>WARNING</code> 可能损害广告表现且未解决会走向 suspend，<code>INFO</code> 是可选优化建议（<a href=\"https://developers.google.com/shopping-content/reference/rest/v2.1/Severity\">https://developers.google.com/shopping-content/reference/rest/v2.1/Severity</a> ）。这三个值比渠道 UI 标签更适合做门禁内部枚举，因为它回答「运维要不要现在动手」。还有一个接口事实：<code>productstatuses</code> 的 <code>ProductStatusItemLevelIssue</code> 里<strong>没有</strong> <code>severity</code> 字段，它用 <code>servability</code> 表达投放影响，另有 <code>resolution</code>、<code>attributeName</code>、<code>code</code>、<code>destination</code>、<code>description</code>、<code>applicableCountries[]</code>（ISO 3166-1 alpha-2）（<a href=\"https://developers.google.com/shopping-content/reference/rest/v2.1/productstatuses\">https://developers.google.com/shopping-content/reference/rest/v2.1/productstatuses</a> ）。只留一个 <code>severity</code> 列，就会丢掉「影响哪个 destination、哪些国家」这两个决定修复优先级的维度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渠道判定语义</th>\n<th>商品是否可服务</th>\n<th>回执是否可见</th>\n<th>本地应触发</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ERROR（Content API Severity）</td>\n<td>否，disapprove 或账号 suspend</td>\n<td>是（issue 列表）</td>\n<td>拦截该 item / 升级账号级告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Disapproval</td>\n<td>否，全渠道停投</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>按 issue code 聚合修复，走申诉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Preemptive item disapproval</td>\n<td>否，需人工复审</td>\n<td>是（原因指向落地页）</td>\n<td>触发性比对，修 feed 或落地页</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Warning（含性能受限/降权）</td>\n<td>是，但曝光与排序受损</td>\n<td>部分（有 warning 才有）</td>\n<td>预警队列 + 观测流量斜率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INFO</td>\n<td>是，无直接损失</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>优化待办，不进拦截</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无任何 issue 但流量下滑</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><strong>否</strong></td>\n<td>靠质量评分自算与流量基线比对</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是软肋：渠道不给 issue 的降权你收不到通知，评分必须<strong>本地自算</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"质量评分的构造-完整性-真实性与可用性\">质量评分的构造：完整性、真实性与可用性</h2><p>本地评分的价值在于把渠道侧三类质量信号合并成一个能排序、能归因、能设阈值的数。</p>\n<p>第一类是<strong>声明完整性</strong>（declaration completeness）。设该品类要求的属性集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{a_1,\\dots,a_n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，每个属性带投放权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<code>price</code>、<code>availability</code>、<code>image_link</code>、<code>gtin</code> 远高于 <code>material</code>），则加权覆盖率</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>decl</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{decl}} = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[a_i \\neq \\varnothing]}{\\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlis