pan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.994em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>唯一的难点是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：把渠道文档里「缺失导致不服务」的属性给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，「缺失只降低可见性」的给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≪</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i \\ll 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。Google 规范把两类分得很清——标题与描述缺失时「your product won&#39;t be able to serve in ads and free listings」，而「有 GTIN 却未提交」只是「may have limited visibility」（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/7052112\">https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/7052112</a> ）。权重设成一样，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>decl</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{decl}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decl</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就会把「能服务但缺 GTIN」与「根本不能服务」算成差不多的分数。可直接当常量的规格数字：标题 ≤150 字符、描述 ≤5000 字符、GTIN 单值 ≤14 位、图片最低 500×500 px 的执行从 <strong>2027 年 1 月 31 日</strong>开始。\n第二类是<strong>声明真实性</strong>（declaration consistency），即 feed 值与落地页实际值是否一致。它无法在出站前判定，只能靠定期抓取比对，但后果最重：价格或库存不一致直接触发 PID。可操作指标是固定窗口内的不一致率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>drift</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>mismatch</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>sampled</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{drift}} = N_{\\text{mismatch}} / N_{\\text{sampled}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">drift</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mismatch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sampled</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，按 destination 分组——同一 SKU 面向德国与面向美国可能是不同落地页，不能混算。</p>\n<p>第三类是<strong>可用性</strong>（servability），即商品能否真的被买到。这最容易被评分模型漏掉：字段全齐、价格一致的商品，若库存为 0 而 <code>availability</code> 仍写 <code>in_stock</code>，在渠道眼里就是标题党。Google 要求 out-of-stock 商品仍带价格，且 <code>availability</code> 合法值只有 <code>in_stock</code>、<code>out_of_stock</code>、<code>preorder</code>、<code>backorder</code> 四种。</p>\n<p>合成时不要简单求和。每个商品产出三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>decl</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>drift</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>avail</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(q_{\\text{decl}}, r_{\\text{drift}}, s_{\\text{avail}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decl</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">drift</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">avail</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，再用分层规则排序队列——三类修复动作完全不同（补字段 / 修同步 / 修库存），压成一个数会让修复人无从下手。</p>\n<h2 id=\"降权与拦截的判定链\">降权与拦截的判定链</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[商品质量信号&lt;br/&gt;完整性 / 一致性 / 可用性] --&gt; B{必填属性缺失?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[不可服务&lt;br/&gt;必须修后才能出站]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D{价格或库存&lt;br/&gt;与落地页不一致?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[PID 风险&lt;br/&gt;标记为待复审]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F{政策或认证断言&lt;br/&gt;命中?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[Disapproval 风险&lt;br/&gt;人工放行或撤回]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H{可选属性&lt;br/&gt;覆盖率低于阈值?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[降权风险&lt;br/&gt;进预警队列]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| J[健康]&#10;  C --&gt; K[修复闭环]&#10;  E --&gt; K&#10;  G --&gt; K&#10;  I --&gt; K&#10;  K --&gt; L[重推 + 回执确认]&#10;  L --&gt;|issue 未消失| A\">graph TD\n  A[商品质量信号&lt;br/&gt;完整性 / 一致性 / 可用性] --&gt; B{必填属性缺失?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[不可服务&lt;br/&gt;必须修后才能出站]\n  B --&gt;|否| D{价格或库存&lt;br/&gt;与落地页不一致?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[PID 风险&lt;br/&gt;标记为待复审]\n  D --&gt;|否| F{政策或认证断言&lt;br/&gt;命中?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[Disapproval 风险&lt;br/&gt;人工放行或撤回]\n  F --&gt;|否| H{可选属性&lt;br/&gt;覆盖率低于阈值?}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[降权风险&lt;br/&gt;进预警队列]\n  H --&gt;|否| J[健康]\n  C --&gt; K[修复闭环]\n  E --&gt; K\n  G --&gt; K\n  I --&gt; K\n  K --&gt; L[重推 + 回执确认]\n  L --&gt;|issue 未消失| A</pre><p>链上有一个反直觉的设计点：<strong>「降权风险」这一支不应该拦截出站</strong>。低完整性商品应继续投放并同时排入补全队列——拦截的曝光损失是 100%，降权的损失只是部分。把预警当拦截用会让出站率崩塌、运维绕过门禁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"修复闭环-从-issue-到规则-语料与验证\">修复闭环：从 issue 到规则、语料与验证</h2><p>修复闭环的最小定义：<strong>每一条质量缺陷都能定位到一个可修复的层，修完能被同等条件重新验证，且同一缺陷不再复发。</strong> 缺任何一项，闭环就退化成人工洗数据。</p>\n<p>归因是最贵的一步：同一句「商品被拒」可能源自四个不同的层。判据是这条 issue 在<strong>其他商品上是否复现</strong>：只有个别商品复现 → 数据层；某渠道某品类整体复现 → 映射层；某渠道所有品类复现 → 规则层或凭证层；跨渠道复现 → 真相源。这个「复现范围」启发式能把多数归因自动化。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缺陷类型</th>\n<th>归因层</th>\n<th>修复动作</th>\n<th>验证方式</th>\n<th>目标 SLA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>必填枚举写错（<code>in stock</code> vs <code>in_stock</code>）</td>\n<td>映射层</td>\n<td>修 transform 原语 + 枚举白名单</td>\n<td>语料回归 + 重推回执</td>\n<td>小时级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格与落地页不一致（PID）</td>\n<td>同步层或落地页</td>\n<td>对齐同步频率或修落地页缓存</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>drift</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{drift}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">drift</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下降</td>\n<td>小时级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺 GTIN 导致可见性受限</td>\n<td>数据层</td>\n<td>补标识符，或改 <code>identifier_exists</code></td>\n<td>覆盖率观测</td>\n<td>天级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>政策断言命中（认证/披露）</td>\n<td>规则层或真相源</td>\n<td>补合规字段或撤回该市场</td>\n<td>规则单测 + 人工放行</td>\n<td>天级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图片分辨率不达标</td>\n<td>数据层</td>\n<td>重采样到 500×500 以上</td>\n<td>分辨率分布检查</td>\n<td>天级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账号级 warning 累积</td>\n<td>治理层</td>\n<td>全量体检 + 批量申诉</td>\n<td>warning 清零</td>\n<td>按渠道期限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>SLA 不能拍脑袋：Google 的 Misrepresentation 执法给了期限常数——多数违规的 warning 期是 <strong>7 或 28 个日历日</strong>，对不可用商品、操纵性媒体、不可靠宣称几类，Google 承诺「at least 7 days prior to any suspension」；账号复审一般需 <strong>7 个工作日</strong>（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/6150127\">https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/6150127</a> ）。修复窗口上限就是渠道给的 warning 期。</p>\n<p>闭环最容易出的反模式是<strong>用刷分替代修复</strong>。当评分变成 KPI，第一反应是往可选字段填占位内容把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>decl</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{decl}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decl</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 顶上去（如 <code>material: &quot;N/A&quot;</code>）。分数好看而渠道判定不变，因为渠道看的是「字段值是否与落地页一致」而非「字段是否非空」。防御很直接：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>decl</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{decl}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decl</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只进「待办排序」，不进「完成判定」；完成判定只认渠道 issue 消失或抓取比对通过。</p>\n<h2 id=\"监控-把降权当一等信号\">监控：把降权当一等信号</h2><p>降权收不到回执，监控必须自建两条独立链路。</p>\n<p>第一条是<strong>渠道 issue 聚合链路</strong>：按 <code>code</code>（或本地 <code>ruleId</code>）× <code>destination</code> × <code>applicableCountries[]</code> 聚合商品数，得到每个问题的影响面。关键指标是「影响面」而非「错误数」——只影响 3 个 SKU 的 ERROR 不值得半夜叫醒人，影响 8000 个 SKU 的 WARNING 值得。</p>\n<p>第二条是<strong>流量与可见性的基线比对链路</strong>：为每个 destination × 品类维护曝光/点击基线（同周几、同时段平滑值），当某分组曝光偏离基线超阈值而同期无 issue 时，才是「无回执降权」的候选。它只给候选、不给结论——会被季节性与竞价变化污染——但它是唯一能发现最后一类问题的机制。降权覆盖面定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>demoted</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>serving</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>demoted</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext>dev</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> issue</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = \\frac{|P_{\\text{demoted}}|}{|P_{\\text{serving}}|}, \\qquad P_{\\text{demoted}} = \\{p : \\text{dev}(p) &lt; -\\theta \\ \\wedge\\ \\text{issue}(p) = \\varnothing\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3991em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">serving</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">demoted</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">demoted</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dev</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">issue</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>dev</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{dev}(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dev</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是商品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的曝光相对基线偏离，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 是判定阈值。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 不降反升，说明质量评分漏掉了某类信号。</p>\n<p>闭环本身也要度量：核心指标是<strong>同 code 复发率</strong>——某个 issue code 标记修复后，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 天内再次出现在同类商品上的比例。复发率高说明修的是数据而不是规则。每条「渠道发现而本地没拦住」的 issue 都是一条待补的规则：补规则流程见 <a href=\"validation-rule-engine-preflight\">校验规则引擎与出站 Preflight 质量门</a>，合规类断言的建模见 <a href=\"regulatory-content-compliance-rules\">跨境商品内容合规规则建模</a>。闭环的终点不是商品上架，而是本地规则集不再让同类问题流到渠道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>拦截有回执、可 join、可自动归因，降权零回执、只能自算——这个差异决定了整套设计。本地须把渠道判定建模成梯度：用 Content API 的 <code>ERROR</code>/<code>WARNING</code>/<code>INFO</code> 做内部枚举，用官方 Warnings / Disapprovals / PID 对齐口径，保留 <code>servability</code>、<code>resolution</code>、<code>destination</code>、<code>applicableCountries[]</code> 四个维度。质量评分拆成完整性、真实性、可用性三元组，权重按「缺失是否导致不服务」区分。判定链上「降权风险」只预警不拦截。修复闭环靠复现范围归因，完成判定只认渠道 issue 消失或抓取比对通过。SLA 锚定渠道给的 7/28 天 warning 期与 7 个工作日复审期。监控自建 issue 聚合与流量基线两条链路，降权覆盖率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 与同 code 复发率是衡量闭环是否收敛的两个数。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>拦截与降权分开建模</strong>：拦截有回执可 join 可归因，降权零回执只能自算，须用官方 Warnings/Disapprovals/PID 对齐本地枚举。</li>\n<li><strong>质量评分拆三元组</strong>：完整性、真实性、可用性，权重按「缺失是否导致不服务」区分；降权风险只预警不拦截。</li>\n<li><strong>修复闭环靠复现归因</strong>：完成判定只认渠道 issue 消失或抓取比对通过，SLA 锚定 7/28 天 warning 期与 7 工作日复审。</li>\n<li><strong>监控两条链路</strong>：issue 聚合 + 流量基线，用降权覆盖率与同 code 复发率判断闭环是否收敛。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"商品质量评分、渠道降权与修复闭环","id":"商品质量评分-渠道降权与修复闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：质量不是布尔，是可服务性梯度","id":"核心概念-质量不是布尔-是可服务性梯度"},{"level":2,"text":"质量评分的构造：完整性、真实性与可用性","id":"质量评分的构造-完整性-真实性与可用性"},{"level":2,"text":"降权与拦截的判定链","id":"降权与拦截的判定链"},{"level":2,"text":"修复闭环：从 issue 到规则、语料与验证","id":"修复闭环-从-issue-到规则-语料与验证"},{"level":2,"text":"监控：把降权当一等信号","id":"监控-把降权当一等信号"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"校验规则引擎与出站 Preflight 质量门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-content-syndication-multichannel-feed-ops/compliance-validation-quality/validation-rule-engine-preflight"},"next":{"title":"渠道回执摄取与条目状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-content-syndication-multichannel-feed-ops/ack-reconciliation-ops/feed-ack-ingestion-status-model"}}